<section id="answer">
<p class="kick">EXECUTIVE ANSWER · 01</p>
<h2>Commercial growth is real. Its causes are only partly visible.</h2>
<p>Commercial supplied 60.3% of FY2025 net revenue growth. The accounts do not show sponsorship-only growth or partner ROI. <a href="#A1">[A1, </a><a href="#A2">A2]</a></p>
</section>

