<details>
<summary>What the evidence does not show</summary>
<ul class="ticks">
<li>Established: commercial revenue grew materially, rights expanded, community work has documented substance and European football paid large distributions. <a href="#A1">[A1-A4, P1-P11, C1-C6, F2]</a></li>
