<h2>An Arsenal fan before I was an analyst.</h2>
<p>I stood by the club through one of its hardest modern seasons and bought the official adidas jersey.</p>
<p>The 2019/20 away shirt was the adidas tribute to the early-1990s &#x27;bruised banana&#x27; kit. Arsenal finished eighth that season, their lowest league finish since 1994/95. Unai Emery left in November 2019 and Mikel Arteta took over that December. The rebuild this page traces started there. <a href="#A5">[A5, </a><a href="#F9">F9]</a></p>
